{"lyrics":"[Intro: Juice WRLD & Ally Lotti]\n[00:02.78] Everybody doin' that Cheese and Dope challenge on Instagram, that's funny\n[00:05.44] You what I'm sayin'? You know that shit? (What?)\n[00:07.34] Cheese and dope shit, that Project Pat (Yeah)\n[Verse: Juice WRLD & Ally Lotti]\n[00:12.40] Bitch, I'm better, bitch, I'm better, bitch, I'm better, bitch, I'm better\n[00:15.72] I do better, I do better, I do better, I do better\n[00:18.80] You wanna fight? You wanna fight? You wanna fight? You wanna fight?\n[00:21.98] Juice Mayweather, Juice Mayweather, Juice Mayweather, Juice Mayweather (Ha-ha-ha-ha)\n[00:25.24] Look at the way I'ma spit this shit, look at the way I used to hit them licks\n[00:28.20] I was back in the Chi', I was runnin' through the 6, like Drake, but I don't got no woes for shit\n[00:31.58] Pull up on the scene with the chopper, like, \"Damn,\" nigga shoot him in his face, but it hit his bitch\n[00:34.84] All I know is get the cash, stack it, yeah, after that make you flip\n[00:37.94] Smokin' on dope, smokin' on dope, sellin' that dope, I'm in the trap\n[00:41.18] Used to have brown in a bag, used to serve it out my lab\n[00:44.36] Fifty more dollars, had to pay to get high in my house\n[00:47.58] But if you was tweakin', fuck it, load that clip, and I kick you out\n[00:50.84] I got cheese, hoes, and a bunch of fuckin' dope\n[00:54.04] I got P's, coke, and some killers at the door\n[00:57.16] Niggas fake, lip syncin', Milli Vanilli on these hoes\n[01:00.34] I'm just poppin' like a wheelie, like Meek Milly on the go, ayy\n[01:03.98] Off of the molly, I'm a whole different person\n[01:05.50] Snakes in the grass, but I see the serpent\n[01:07.16] Run up on me, I get to murkin'\n[01:08.72] Gun is a bird, it get to chirpin'\n[01:10.40] Ooh, ayy, ayy, she tell me I'm pretty, I say, \"I'm prettier in person,\" ooh, ayy\n[01:14.42] I thank God every day, he bless me with this discernment, uh\n[01:17.16] I see demons, I see demons, I see angels, uh\n[01:19.92] My eyes are like cameras, and I see it from different angles, uh, ayy\n[01:23.52] Run up on me, you get shot, huh, gun on my hip, uh-uh, ayy\n[01:26.70] Boy, this bitch Hot Pocket, huh, yeah, I got a pocket rocket, huh, ayy\n[01:30.32] Project Pat, uh, I'm a project kid, uh\n[01:33.12] Hit you in yo' stomach, bullets, you digestin' it\n[01:35.82] I never had no Section 8, no, I lived in that Section A\n[01:39.18] UP, University Park, that's where I was at, that's where we fuckin' stayed, ayy\n[01:42.70] We was in Cal' Park, ayy, uppin' the hunnids, ayy, ayy\n[01:45.90] Niggas in Rosen, ayy, ayy, gettin' that money, ayy, ayy\n[01:49.16] Over east up in the streets, actin' grimy, ayy, ayy\n[01:52.04] I ain't Thug, but some my niggas'll get real slimey, ayy, ayy\n[01:55.48] Huh, .40 with that 30, I deserve it\n[01:58.08] I'm ballin' for that green, I'm shootin' on my Larry Bird shit\n[02:01.50] Niggas know what's up, I'm in the kitchen, like I'm Keurig\n[02:04.70] Whippin', whippin', flippin' chickens, Harold's to the churches\n[02:07.90] Niggas know what's up with me, in the kitchen with the cutlery\n[02:11.08] Ballin', Jimmy Butler, rushin', I was Chrissy Tucker, please\n[02:14.28] Get the fuck back, 'fore we fuck up yo' set\n[02:17.02] Droppin' sets, loadin' TECs\n[02:18.64] Hit your face and your neck\n[02:20.28] Bitch, I'm ballin', don't need rebounds, I'm dunkin' on the bitch\n[02:23.50] Up in school, I couldn't do no work, I was flunkin' in that bitch\n[02:26.68] High as fuck, off the Xans, sleep in class, fuck the work\n[02:29.88] Matter of fact, after class, I was probably sellin' work\n[02:33.18] I had Addys for the thirty, I had Vyvanse for the ten\n[02:36.38] I had all types of Xans I used to pass up to my friends\n[02:39.50] Who get high outside of lunch, after that, probably skip school\n[02:42.78] I was ridin' around the city with my motherfuckin' tool, uh\n[02:46.28] Used to leave the 'burbs, go back to the city\n[02:49.44] Gun with a pretty pea coat, Pretty Ricky\n[02:52.22] You get shot in yo' back, if you think this shit sweet\n[02:55.44] Mask on me, it ain't Halloween, still trick or treat\n[02:58.68] All these hoes wanna fuck on me, they can't get dick for free\n[03:01.80] Matter of fact, can't get dick at all, 'cause these bitches ain't for me\n[03:04.98] They be triflin', they be triflin', tryna rob, tryna scheme\n[03:08.28] If a bitch try to set me or my brothers up, might leave her on the scene, uh\n[03:13.00] See, my gun is bisexual, it also knows a lot of big words, it's perplexual\n[03:18.00] See, bitch, I be flexin' and my life is on a pedestal\n[03:21.22] I'm just like KISS or somethin', I got that heavy metal, and I'm rockin'\n[03:25.10] Ha-ha-ha-ha","words":[[2.78,3.08,"Everybody"],[3.16,3.28,"doin'"],[3.32,3.46,"that"],[3.5,3.7,"Cheese"],[3.74,3.78,"and"],[3.84,3.98,"Dope"],[4.04,4.4,"challenge"],[4.44,4.54,"on"],[4.62,4.94,"Instagram,"],[5.0,5.14,"that's"],[5.22,5.4,"funny"],[5.44,5.5,"You"],[5.54,5.6,"what"],[5.64,5.68,"I'm"],[5.82,6.02,"sayin'?"],[6.08,6.12,"You"],[6.16,6.22,"know"],[6.28,6.36,"that"],[6.44,6.5,"shit?"],[6.94,7.3,"(What?)"],[7.34,7.56,"Cheese"],[7.6,7.66,"and"],[7.7,7.9,"dope"],[7.94,8.12,"shit,"],[8.3,8.36,"that"],[8.42,8.74,"Project"],[8.78,8.88,"Pat"],[8.92,9.02,"(Yeah)"],[12.4,12.56,"Bitch,"],[12.6,12.68,"I'm"],[12.78,12.98,"better,"],[13.2,13.36,"bitch,"],[13.4,13.48,"I'm"],[13.52,13.72,"better,"],[14.02,14.18,"bitch,"],[14.24,14.32,"I'm"],[14.4,14.58,"better,"],[14.82,14.96,"bitch,"],[15.02,15.12,"I'm"],[15.2,15.68,"better"],[15.72,15.72,"I"],[15.76,15.82,"do"],[15.98,16.18,"better,"],[16.44,16.44,"I"],[16.56,16.62,"do"],[16.8,17.3,"better,"],[17.34,17.34,"I"],[17.38,17.44,"do"],[17.5,17.7,"better,"],[17.76,17.76,"I"],[18.16,18.22,"do"],[18.38,18.72,"better"],[18.8,18.84,"You"],[18.88,19.0,"wanna"],[19.14,19.38,"fight?"],[19.6,19.64,"You"],[19.7,19.82,"wanna"],[19.96,20.34,"fight?"],[20.4,20.44,"You"],[20.5,20.64,"wanna"],[20.76,21.18,"fight?"],[21.22,21.26,"You"],[